age and list of common available times to send her.\n\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","index":0,"id":"tool_append_workspace_4vi4tOnhHXMcpR665fRo","function":{"name":"append_workspace","arguments":"{\"text\":\"Hi Alison, I've checked Elena's and David's calendars. Unfortunately, none of the slots you suggested work for them. Here are their common available 30-minute slots for next week. Can you check these against Priya's and Marcus's calendars?\\n\\nMon Nov 16: 11:00, 11:30\\nTue Nov 17: 09:00, 09:30\\nWed Nov 18: 11:30, 13:00, 13:30\\nThu Nov 19: 09:30, 14:30, 15:00\\nFri Nov 20: 15:00, 15:30\\n\\nThanks, Brad\"}"}},{"type":"function","index":1,"id":"tool_end_session_T8kAVOCR1FtCUMPmhypW","function":{"name":"end_session","arguments":"{}"}}],"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Comparing Availability Calendars**\n\nI've got Elena and David's calendars and am cross-referencing their availability against Alison's proposed slots. So far, I'm focusing on finding the overlaps for Monday and Tuesday. I'll move on to Wednesday as soon as I can.\n\n\n**Analyzing Availability Details**\n\nI've just finished going through all of the potential slots for this week. I cross-referenced the calendars of Elena, David, and Alison, checking for conflicts. I found that none of the proposed slots are available, given the three of them. I'm taking a break now, but I will provide an alternative solution, once I have a chance.\n\n\n**Re-Analyzing Availability Conflicts**\n\nI've re-examined the calendars and Alison's proposed slots. My review confirms that none of the suggested times work, given Elena and David's commitments. I systematically checked each slot, matching it against the available and busy times on each calendar. My conclusions are consistent with my initial analysis, and I need to come up with new possible slots.\n\n\n**Confirming Availability Analysis**\n\nI've re-reviewed the calendars and Alison's suggested slots, to cross-check my previous results. My analysis remains unchanged; none of the proposed times are available due to conflicts with Elena and David's schedules. I need to generate alternate slots for Alison's consideration.\n\n\n**Identifying Overlaps**\n\nI've meticulously cross-referenced the calendars, confirming that Alison's suggested times are unavailable for Elena and David. To resolve this, I'm now actively pinpointing common free slots for both Elena and David, preparing to propose viable alternatives. I'll focus on this week's open 30-minute intervals.\n\n\n**Confirming Availability Analysis**\n\nI've re-reviewed the calendars and confirmed my analysis. None of Alison's proposed slots are viable, due to conflicts for Elena and David. I need to generate alternate slots and communicate the details to Alison. I've prepared a concise message and list of common available times to send her.\n\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":1}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":4265,"completion_tokens":3763,"total_tokens":8028,"cost":0.04296125,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.04296125,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.00533125,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.03763},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2944,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}